WEBVTT

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:54.440
At last...

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:56.400
we've come this far.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:58.870
No doubt about it.

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:00.340
That's true...

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.580
After fifty days of ferocious battles...

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:09.080
this long journey...

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:11.520
is coming to an end here.

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:26.860
There's no sign of life.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:27.630
Yeah.

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:30.800
Even the windows are closed from inside.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.770
It looks abandoned.

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:34.400
Jotaro...

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:36.770
I'm sure you feel it, too...

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.710
this deathly atmosphere.

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:42.940
A devil who possess the
life force of darkness...

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:44.390
There's no mistake...

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:45.320
it's Dio!

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.750
He's inside here!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.030
Dio...I'll take care of him.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.760
The conclusion of this journey...

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.030
is the conclusion to this phase of my life!

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.100
No matter how powerful he is...

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:02.000
I'll definitely cut him up with my own hands!

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:02.940
Polnareff...

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:09.110
It is very dangerous to go off on your own.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.540
Once we enter the mansion...

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:13.120
you must follow Mr. Joestar's instructions.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.220
You must!

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.750
There's no need for you
to worry so much, Avdol.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.860
After coming this far, don't
tell me you're freaking out...?

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:23.760
What!?

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:29.900
We don't have much time.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:30.690
Let's go.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.430
Instead of worrying about me...

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:36.170
you should look after that dumb dog.

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:41.450
Although when the time
comes, I'm sure he'll run away.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.540
I won't force you to come along.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:49.190
This time for sure, we'll risk
our lives to fight this battle...

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:59.360
I'll leave you all the gum I have.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:01.060
If I survive...

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:04.360
I'll take you back to your
hometown in New York.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:05.530
I promise.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.580
I suppose that Dio...

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:57.150
knows we're here.

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:01.080
Let's make a big entrance.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:16.700
Hang on...

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:18.110
be strong, Holley.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.940
Mrs. Joestar...

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.880
I understand how you feel...

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:24.010
but Ms. Holley is in a coma.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.050
She can't hear your voice.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:29.450
So please, go and get some rest.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.710
You haven't slept for two days already.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.810
How dare you say such thing...

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.620
when her life is hanging by a thread!

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:37.820
For goodness sake...

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:42.530
with Joseph and Jotaro not
returning at such a critical moment...

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:46.070
If I don't watch over her, what are we to do?

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.040
Jo...taro...

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:54.710
Papa...

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:56.510
Jotaro...

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:58.180
I believe in you.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:08:59.470
Jo...

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.820
Are you awake!?

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:03.210
Holley...

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:03.910
Holley!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:06.820
Mama...

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.420
I know it...

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.060
Papa and...

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:12.890
Jotaro too...

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.760
for my sake...

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:17.100
they're doing their best right now.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.470
I...believe in them...

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.070
I don't believe it...

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:23.700
Ms. Holley hasn't regained consciousness.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.070
It can't be!

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.770
She shouldn't be able to speak at all...!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.100
I believe in you...

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:31.340
Jotaro...

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.440
I believe...

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:36.750
Be strong, Holley...

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.080
Believe in him...

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:40.420
your son...

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.080
my grandson!

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:43.460
To believe in him...

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.890
is our battle!

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:11.950
There's something behind us!

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:18.530
W-what the...

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.930
it's just a rat!

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.400
Don't scare me like that!

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.860
This is...

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:53.020
Dio's coffin.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.900
I'm letting the sunlight in.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.250
We know...

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:15.510
the man we are about to meet.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:18.920
We know him from before
Jotaro or I were even born.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:20.320
Yes...

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:24.090
the Joestar's blood knows this man.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.160
The battle we are about to begin...

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:31.000
no matter what the
outcome, I have no regrets.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:35.230
I want no regrets...that's
why I'm here right now.

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:40.210
How long are you going to stare at it!?

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.180
If no one's going to do it, then I'll open it!

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:43.700
Don't open it so carelessly!

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.220
Carelessly...!?

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.650
Are you saying I'm careless!?

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:53.960
Mr. Joestar...

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:56.050
Allow me to use my fire here.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:11:59.560
Hey!

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:00.960
Don't you ignore me!

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.490
Stay back!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.250
This is...!?

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:57.450
It can't be...!

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.630
W-Why am I...?

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:12.640
H...

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:13.830
How...?

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.070
Avdol!

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:17.730
Wait!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.140
Don't move!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.240
Old man...!?

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:22.640
Jotaro!

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:23.610
You too!

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:24.980
Think for a moment...

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:26.880
what happened just now!?

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.690
If we act carelessly, we'll all be destroyed!

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.020
Dio!?

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.250
Is it Dio!?

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:34.220
Bastard...where is he!?

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:36.320
What did he do!?

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.320
Run...

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:38.330
Pol...

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.830
Get away...

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:40.760
from...

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:41.660
from me...!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.310
You've finally arrived here.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:00.780
I must congratulate you all for your efforts.

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.050
Bastaaard...!

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:05.390
You're...

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.520
Dio...!

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:10.950
Dio's secret...

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:12.330
His...

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:13.790
Stand's...

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:15.790
secret is...

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:17.730
Do it!

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:19.360
Run!

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:43.980
Come here, Iced.

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:49.630
He is...

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:50.890
Iced.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.460
You may have heard about him from D'Arby.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:55.790
I...

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:59.070
took him under my wing
as my right-hand man.

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:01.040
What did you do...?

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:03.140
What did you do to Avdol...!?

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:04.540
Where is he!?

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.110
Calm down, Polnareff.

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:10.250
Why are you so anxious?

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:13.350
Are you afraid...of me, Dio?

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:17.390
Look at him.

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:19.520
He obeys me...

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.190
without any fear or anxiety.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:24.260
Hey...

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:26.060
Iced...

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:27.730
You...

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.030
why don't you cut your head off?

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:43.540
Can you understand why
he obeys me so blindly?

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:47.450
It's because he feels
secure about serving me.

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:50.460
Because of their Stand abilities...

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:52.390
and the superior power they possessed...

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:55.290
they were shunned by society.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:56.260
But...

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.270
by serving me...

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:02.170
all worthless feelings like loneliness
and insecurity are gone for good.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.860
Do you know why?

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:05.000
That is...

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:08.480
because I, Dio, am the
ultimate, absolute power.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:18.390
A worthy man like you...

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:23.380
shouldn't be left to die in a place like this.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.890
With my blood...

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.590
may you be resurrected...

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.790
Iced.

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:37.130
Well...

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:38.810
you who've taken all that trouble...

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:45.350
come all the way to Egypt, with some
crazed idea to kill me, Dio...uhhh...huh?

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:46.140
Um...?

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.410
Joseph...and Jotaro, right?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:53.750
I must give you the
punishment of absolute death.

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:56.920
I must end my karma with the Joestar family.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.930
But Polnareff...

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:04.060
You would be such a waste to kill.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:07.330
You are quite an excellent Stand user.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:10.530
How about it?

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.840
Along with that pup over there...

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:15.380
why don't you become my servant?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.780
If you do...

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.080
you needn't be afraid of death any longer.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:22.480
You shall obtain absolute security!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:24.950
Shut your mouth.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:26.150
What?

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:29.060
Shut your mouth, I said!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:29.960
Dio!

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:32.390
That's not what I'm asking you!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.260
What did you do with Avdol!?

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:37.100
I'm asking, where did you take him!?

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.970
Why bother yourself with such petty details.

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:43.500
Tell him...

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:44.670
Iced.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.270
Avdol is...

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.000
dead.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.680
My Stand created a sub-dimension
into which he was swallowed...

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.310
and disappeared without a trace.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.590
Where Avdol has disappeared to...

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.420
even I don't know.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:06.720
BASTARD!

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:11.930
Such pressure!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:17.640
It's such a waste to kill a man like
yourself, but it can't be helped.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.040
Just die, then.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:22.010
Deal with him, Iced.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.220
Shut your yap!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.130
What!?

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:48.770
Polnareff!

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:55.940
You should be pleased.

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:57.450
Old fool and lad...

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.950
I, Dio, will deal with you personally.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.260
Did he run away?

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:19.360
Perhaps that pup...

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:21.270
is smarter than you both?

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:25.170
Bastard...!

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.720
Damn it...!

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:39.510
That guy...

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:40.820
where did he disappear to?

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:56.630
Th...

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:58.300
This is crazy!

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:21.670
Bastard...

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:25.610
he absorbs everything in his path.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:28.220
Th...

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:29.380
This is a bad spot!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.380
There's nothing around for cover!?

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:34.480
I'd better move...

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:48.000
I took your leg out first...

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:50.500
so you won't be able to scurry around.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:56.200
I'll have to discipline you for foolishly
thinking you can disobey Lord Dio.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.100
Where do you want it next?

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:58.940
Your arm...?

00:20:59.080 --> 00:20:59.810
Your gut...?

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:01.710
You shit bastard...!

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:09.350
Spray...!?

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:35.440
I can only cut him when he's visible!?

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:36.650
Dio!

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:37.440
You...!

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:38.140
Wait!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:46.290
Th...

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:47.050
This is...!?

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:52.770
What's wrong?

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:55.390
How long are you planning
to take to come up here?

00:21:55.700 --> 00:21:56.860
Bastard...!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:03.110
Where are you attacking?

00:22:03.410 --> 00:22:04.170
It can't be...!

00:22:04.310 --> 00:22:04.900
When did he...?

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:09.680
He hasn't moved?

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:10.780
Is this his Stand's ability!?

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:15.010
To tell you the truth, Joseph...

00:22:15.120 --> 00:22:16.280
there's something I need...

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:17.920
from you.

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:18.890
To be precise...

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:20.080
I should say...

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:22.130
I need your fresh blood.

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:23.900
What's that...!?

00:22:24.430 --> 00:22:26.700
From this, Dio's neck, down...

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:29.630
is my long standing enemy,
Jonathan Joestar's body.

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:32.900
It is not a comfortable fit just yet.

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:37.230
Among all the humans alive, Joseph...

00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:40.510
you are the Joestar family's oldest survivor.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:44.810
Do you see?

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:46.320
Your blood...

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:48.820
is closest to that of Jonathan's.

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:50.110
Jotaro...

00:22:50.490 --> 00:22:51.720
Run!

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:53.120
What!?

00:22:56.460 --> 00:22:58.730
By sucking your fresh blood...

00:22:58.870 --> 00:23:01.530
I will completely conquer this body.

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:02.730
In addition...

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:04.330
one hundred long years...

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:06.060
of this karma with Joestar family...

00:23:06.170 --> 00:23:07.730
will finally come to an end.

00:23:08.310 --> 00:23:10.570
It's me he's after!

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:11.940
Hurry, get away!

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:13.240
Are you kidding!?

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:14.970
Why should I run now!?

00:23:15.980 --> 00:23:16.240
I...

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:18.250
You really should listen...

00:23:18.320 --> 00:23:20.450
to what your elders say, Jotaro.

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:26.360
Although, I have no intention
of letting you go that easily.

00:23:48.720 --> 00:23:49.680
This is...

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:52.480
not about being fast, or playing tricks..!

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:54.180
I...Is...

00:23:54.260 --> 00:23:56.120
this Dio's Stand!?

00:23:56.820 --> 00:23:59.090
'The World's'power?

00:23:59.530 --> 00:24:00.890
Well...

00:24:01.030 --> 00:24:02.020
you old fool?

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.120
For you...

00:24:05.230 --> 00:24:07.030
this marks the end.

00:24:30.060 --> 00:24:31.320
What a persistent guy.

00:25:01.090 --> 00:25:02.060
It's no good...

00:25:02.120 --> 00:25:04.060
my b-body...

00:25:04.120 --> 00:25:05.680
I can't move...

00:25:06.230 --> 00:25:12.170
It was only for a little while, but you
should thank Avdol for extending your life.

00:25:12.930 --> 00:25:15.800
At that time, if he hadn't pushed you away...

00:25:15.900 --> 00:25:19.860
you would've been swallowed
by the sub-dimension together.

00:25:20.010 --> 00:25:24.670
He could've survived if
he'd tried to escape alone.

00:25:27.210 --> 00:25:28.610
What an idiot.

00:25:29.920 --> 00:25:31.580
'Idiot,' you say...?

00:25:33.120 --> 00:25:36.090
They say the more foolish
you are, the younger you die.

00:25:36.420 --> 00:25:36.910
Y...

00:25:37.520 --> 00:25:38.990
You...!

00:25:45.970 --> 00:25:48.090
You can still move?

00:25:48.240 --> 00:25:50.230
But, this is the end.

00:25:50.370 --> 00:25:54.710
Die as you regret your own stupidity.

00:26:24.970 --> 00:26:25.670
Iggi...!?

00:26:25.810 --> 00:26:27.140
Y-You...

00:26:30.680 --> 00:26:33.770
You...came to my rescue?

00:26:35.820 --> 00:26:37.340
Sorry...

00:26:37.480 --> 00:26:38.450
I...

00:26:38.590 --> 00:26:42.040
thought you'd be long gone by now.

00:26:42.690 --> 00:26:45.490
I didn't even consider you my comrade...

00:26:46.530 --> 00:26:47.990
But you...

00:26:52.800 --> 00:26:54.600
Thanks a lot, Iggi.

00:26:54.740 --> 00:26:57.170
You were able to avenge Avdol.

00:26:57.300 --> 00:26:59.970
I wished I could've done it myself, though.

00:27:03.010 --> 00:27:04.380
Run, Iggi!

00:27:05.110 --> 00:27:06.580
He's...still alive!

00:27:08.120 --> 00:27:09.310
Iggi!

00:27:18.760 --> 00:27:20.780
You lowly mutt...

00:27:20.860 --> 00:27:22.390
Lord Dio...

00:27:23.130 --> 00:27:25.390
how dare you defy him!?

00:27:26.470 --> 00:27:27.830
Know your place!

00:27:38.780 --> 00:27:39.910
You too!

00:27:40.380 --> 00:27:40.900
Die!

00:27:54.160 --> 00:27:56.960
Are you that eager to pledge loyalty to Dio?

00:27:57.400 --> 00:27:59.420
Then, do so in hell...!

00:28:18.920 --> 00:28:33.590
Iggi...

00:28:39.110 --> 00:28:42.200
Isn't there anything else
you can do, old fool?

00:28:42.340 --> 00:28:44.110
The sun is about to set!

00:28:56.920 --> 00:28:58.410
Are you ready?

00:29:17.950 --> 00:29:18.410
Ka...

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:19.500
Kakyoin!
